policy report
worldstate WorldStates/Test/elite_ninja.worldstate
call run_include_demo
resolve
raw run_include_demo
rawdeferred run_include_demo
call no_such_method
end

scenario selected/fuzz/IncludeDemoRT/1
planner IncludeDemoRT
policy report
debugger on
fact controlled_entity 7
